{"id":"n34993-1-2","stage":4,"title":"금상첨화 · 锦上添花","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34993-1-2-1","ko":"이 사이트에서 옷을 사면 어떤 점이 좋아?","zh":"在这个网站买衣服有什么好处呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이트에서","meaning":"网站","explanation":"사이트：网站；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사이트","audio":"/audio/b2c8d45cf4a07057a749.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61229","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사면","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점이","meaning":"点，片，丝","explanation":"점：点，片，丝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"점","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62381","senseId":"4","lemma":"점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b2c8d45cf4a07057","term":"사이트","zh":"网站","audio":"/audio/b2c8d45cf4a07057a749.mp3","entryId":"61229","definition":"可供网络使用者随时上网并储存有信息的地方。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"59a79337fd9ab69b","term":"점","zh":"点，片，丝","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3","entryId":"62381","definition":"形容非常少的量。","pronunciation":["점"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0daac9a9fc905f7ecc28.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n34993-1-2-2","ko":"옷이 싸면서 디자인도 예뻐서 금상첨화야.","zh":"衣服既便宜又设计漂亮，简直是锦上添花。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸면서","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디자인도","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예뻐서","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금상첨화야.","meaning":"锦上添花","explanation":"금상첨화：锦上添花；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"금상첨화","audio":"/audio/ca804eaab60bd08ec883.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34993","senseId":"1","lemma":"금상첨화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"ca804eaab60bd08e","term":"금상첨화","zh":"锦上添花","audio":"/audio/ca804eaab60bd08ec883.mp3","entryId":"34993","definition":"在绸缎上添上绣花，意思是在好事上又有好事发生。","pronunciation":["금ː상첨화"]}],"audio":"/audio/6557df73916e861ad435.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=34993","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在这个网站买衣服有什么好处呢？","衣服既便宜又设计漂亮，简直是锦上添花。","一个读过大学的人，礼貌程度也太低了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在这个网站买衣服有什么好处呢？","衣服既便宜又设计漂亮，简直是锦上添花。","一个读过大学的人，礼貌程度也太低了。"],"answer":1}]}
